                <pb facs="0482" n="394" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg394"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/684a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-01-09T12:00:00-05:00">January 9, 1933—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6. What is the objection of Colombian Government to accepting Brazil’s modified
                    formula, namely that Peru turn over Leticia to Brazil and that conversations
                    take place immediately in Rio for a maximum period of 3 months duration during
                    which Brazil will hold Leticia? Rush reply.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
